# ROVEXO v1.0 — REAL PRODUCTS ONLY (PERMANENT)

**STATUS: OWNER APPROVED | LOCKED | DEMO CATALOGUE REMOVED**

## Law

```
ONE MARKETPLACE → ONE DATABASE → ONE products TABLE → REAL PRODUCTS ONLY
```

## Forbidden forever

- Demo Listings / Demo Products / Demo Catalogue
- Demo Product Detail fallbacks (`if (!detail) return demo`)
- Demo Buy Now / Checkout / Payment paths for fake slugs
- `filterCanonicalDemoListings()` / homepage demo injectors
- `demo-xxxxxx` catalogue listings (`demo-gaming-chair`, `demo-iphone-*`, `demo-listing-*`, `demo-feed-*`)
- `lib/demo-mode/` catalogue SSOT
- `lib/homepage/demo-data.ts` demo padding
- Env toggles that inject fake inventory: `ROVEXO_DEMO_MODE`, `ROVEXO_HOMEPAGE_DEMO`

## Keep (separate system)

Full Demo **certification accounts** only:

- `demo.buyer@rovexo.co.uk`
- `demo.seller@rovexo.co.uk`

SSOT: `lib/demo-environment/` · `lib/full-demo/` · `.cursor/rules/full-demo-certification-permanent.mdc`

Those accounts buy/sell **real** `products` rows (or empty marketplace). Never a parallel in-memory catalogue.

## Empty marketplace

When no eligible real products exist → empty state / no listings.  
Never pad with mocks, placeholders, or fallback products.

## Surfaces (real DB only)

Homepage · Search · Categories · Listing · Product · Buy Now · Checkout · Payment · Order · Shipping

